    <briefdescription>
<para>AES-CMAC (Cipher-based Message Authentication Code, RFC 4493 / NIST SP 800-38B). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Constant-time, zero-heap message authentication code engine based on AES-128. Standard primitive for BLE Secure Connections, LoRaWAN, AUTOSAR SecOC, and COSE. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
